      "semanticHtml": "<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol><li><a href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">/</li><li aria-current=\"page\">Checkout</li></ol></nav>\n\n<section aria-labelledby=\"h1\">\n <div>\n <div>\n \n <h1><span>Checkout</span></h1>\n <p>Place a standard order for custom puffy or foam stickers: 1 x 2 in, 1 mm puff, from 250 pcs, with free US shipping and a free digital proof.</p>\n <div><div>Your order</div><dl><dt>Product</dt><dd>, </dd><dt>Size</dt><dd>, </dd><dt>Thickness</dt><dd>, </dd><dt>Finish</dt><dd>, </dd><dt>Quantity</dt><dd>, </dd><dt>Package total</dt><dd>, </dd><dt>Shipping</dt><dd>, </dd><dt>Sales tax</dt><dd>, </dd><dt>Total</dt><dd>, </dd></dl><p><a href=\"/puffy-labels-stickers/puffy-stickers/\">Change package</a></p></div><p role=\"alert\">Choose a package first: <a href=\"/puffy-labels-stickers/puffy-stickers/\">puffy stickers</a> or <a href=\"/puffy-labels-stickers/foam-stickers/\">foam stickers</a>.</p><p>Questions before you order? <a href=\"tel:+14079234382\">(407) 923-4382</a> · <a href=\"mailto:sales@puffsticker.com\">sales@puffsticker.com</a></p>\n </div>\n <div><form aria-disabled=\"true\"><div><strong>Place your order</strong><span>Free US shipping · free digital proof</span></div><div><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"product\" disabled=\"\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"qty\" disabled=\"\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"finish\" disabled=\"\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"expected_total\" disabled=\"\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>Website <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" disabled=\"\"></label></div><fieldset><legend>Artwork</legend><label><span>Files * <span>(PDF, AI, EPS, SVG · up to 5 files, 25 MB each, 50 MB in total)</span></span><input name=\"artwork[]\" type=\"file\" disabled=\"\"></label><label><span>Notes (optional)</span><textarea name=\"notes\" placeholder=\"Anything we should know about your artwork\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></label></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Contact</legend><div><label><span>Full name *</span><input name=\"name\" type=\"text\" disabled=\"\"></label><label><span>Email *</span><input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" disabled=\"\"></label><label><span>Phone *</span><input name=\"phone\" type=\"tel\" disabled=\"\"></label><label><span>Company (optional)</span><input name=\"company\" type=\"text\" disabled=\"\"></label></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Shipping address (US only)</legend><div><label><span>Street address *</span><input name=\"address1\" type=\"text\" disabled=\"\"></label><label><span>Apartment, suite, unit (optional)</span><input name=\"address2\" type=\"text\" disabled=\"\"></label><div><label><span>City *</span><input name=\"city\" type=\"text\" disabled=\"\"></label><label><span>State *</span><select name=\"state\" disabled=\"\"><option value=\"\">Choose</option><option value=\"AL\">Alabama</option><option value=\"AK\">Alaska</option><option value=\"AZ\">Arizona</option><option value=\"AR\">Arkansas</option><option value=\"CA\">California</option><option value=\"CO\">Colorado</option><option value=\"CT\">Connecticut</option><option value=\"DE\">Delaware</option><option value=\"DC\">District of Columbia</option><option value=\"FL\">Florida</option><option value=\"GA\">Georgia</option><option value=\"HI\">Hawaii</option><option value=\"ID\">Idaho</option><option value=\"IL\">Illinois</option><option value=\"IN\">Indiana</option><option value=\"IA\">Iowa</option><option value=\"KS\">Kansas</option><option value=\"KY\">Kentucky</option><option value=\"LA\">Louisiana</option><option value=\"ME\">Maine</option><option value=\"MD\">Maryland</option><option value=\"MA\">Massachusetts</option><option value=\"MI\">Michigan</option><option value=\"MN\">Minnesota</option><option value=\"MS\">Mississippi</option><option value=\"MO\">Missouri</option><option value=\"MT\">Montana</option><option value=\"NE\">Nebraska</option><option value=\"NV\">Nevada</option><option value=\"NH\">New Hampshire</option><option value=\"NJ\">New Jersey</option><option value=\"NM\">New Mexico</option><option value=\"NY\">New York</option><option value=\"NC\">North Carolina</option><option value=\"ND\">North Dakota</option><option value=\"OH\">Ohio</option><option value=\"OK\">Oklahoma</option><option value=\"OR\">Oregon</option><option value=\"PA\">Pennsylvania</option><option value=\"RI\">Rhode Island</option><option value=\"SC\">South Carolina</option><option value=\"SD\">South Dakota</option><option value=\"TN\">Tennessee</option><option value=\"TX\">Texas</option><option value=\"UT\">Utah</option><option value=\"VT\">Vermont</option><option value=\"VA\">Virginia</option><option value=\"WA\">Washington</option><option value=\"WV\">West Virginia</option><option value=\"WI\">Wisconsin</option><option value=\"WY\">Wyoming</option></select></label><label><span>ZIP code *</span><input name=\"zip\" type=\"text\" disabled=\"\"></label></div></div></fieldset><div><div>Payment</div><p>Pay by bank transfer or Pay with Wise. We don't accept card payments. Unpaid orders are cancelled after 3 days.</p><p>You will get your order number and a Wise payment link as soon as you place the order. We match your payment by the payer's name and amount. If you pay from an account in another name, reply to your order email and tell us.</p></div><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"terms\" value=\"yes\" disabled=\"\"><span>I agree to the <a href=\"/terms-of-service/\">Terms</a>, <a href=\"/payment-terms/\">Payment Terms</a> and <a href=\"/reprint-policy/\">Reprint Policy</a>.</span></label><p>Orders cancelled after payment but before proof approval receive a full refund. Once the proof is approved and production starts, orders cannot be cancelled.</p><div></div><p role=\"alert\"></p><div><div><div>Total</div><div>, </div></div><button type=\"submit\" disabled=\"\">Place order</button></div></div></form></div>\n </div>\n</section>",
